Household dishwashers fall under heading 8422.11 ("Dishwashing machines: of the household type"). The statistical suffix for 8422.11.00 is 8422.11.0000 in the current HTSUS, so I'm using that.

Heading 9817 (articles for the handicapped) covers articles specially designed for the handicapped, but only certain items. These are ordinary dishwashers at a lower height, and CBP has generally held that this sort of item is not covered by 9817.00.96 because it is not specially designed for the handicapped. I'm going with 8422.11.0000.

{"hts_code": "8422.11.0000", "reason": "Household-type dishwashing machines are classified in heading 8422, subheading 8422.11, and the compact, lower-height design does not make them specially designed articles for the handicapped under 9817."}
